  "automationNotes": "Steps mirror the doc in order. Section 1 (Install): standard Marketplace install. Platform Configuration verifies both Managed by Contentstack and Custom Credentials, clicks Custom Credentials, verifies Provider Name / API Key / API Model (Recommended + All Available Models), then clicks Save and Proceed. Advanced Configuration verifies Custom Name, When field content is selected checkbox, clicks Create Sub-action Prompt and enters example values (Display Name 'Shorten', Value '10%'), toggles Enable search for sub-action. Section 2 (Use): creates 'AI Assistant Test Content Type' with Single Line Textbox + JSON RTE fields (no plugin), Save and Close, creates entry, exercises Field Modifier AI on Title (Rewrite) and Single Line field (Shorten), verifies all popup options (Rewrite, Shorten, custom commands, Outline, Summary, SEO Tags, Blog Posts, Headline, User Persona Tags). All Use section steps are warnOnly since they require the app to be properly configured and Field Modifier UI location enabled.",
